    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 732,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "What does PAIA keep?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b489db01f851",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 795,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA focuses on your own submitted inputs and the provenance needed to revisit them. It",
        "is not a promise to copy every assistant reply or every file."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-68e054397389",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.026",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 891.3,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 891.3,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 918.3,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Do I need to organize everything?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fbbc548f84cc",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 981.3,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Reading, finding, editing and copying useful words should already be valuable. Topics",
        "and optional AI organization are ways to go further, not admission requirements."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5738350082c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.029",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 29,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1077.6,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1077.6,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.030",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 30,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1104.6,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Does everything get sent to AI?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-959dc5038307",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1167.6,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Ordinary archive use is local-first. Optional external AI processing and context reuse",
        "are separate, explicit actions with their own boundaries."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dbd48596dae5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.032",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 32,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1263.8999999999999,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1263.8999999999999,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.033",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 33,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1290.8999999999999,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Which platforms can I use today?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0bbf52a58ad5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.034",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 34,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1353.8999999999999,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "The current invitation-only beta is a Chrome extension with consented ChatGPT input",
        "capture. Other providers, mobile apps and an external AI-reader connector are not",
        "promised as available installations."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d457501a24e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.035",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 35,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1474.85,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1474.85,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.036",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 36,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1501.85,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Why use this alongside chat history?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4a3a52baf411",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.037",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 37,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1564.85,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA is a separate working layer for your own words: revisit, edit, trace the original and",
        "select what to reuse. It can help even when you use only one AI product."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-43a12da5dd60",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.038",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 38,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1661.1499999999999,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1661.1499999999999,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.039",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 39,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1688.1499999999999,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Can I change the wording?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1270025d85bf",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.040",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 40,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1751.1499999999999,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "You can work with an editable version without making today’s changes look like",
        "yesterday’s original expression. The original and the working version have different roles."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-10933f7cd5b7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.041",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 41,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1847.4499999999998,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1847.4499999999998,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.042",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 42,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1874.4499999999998,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is this a backup of my entire AI account?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2570e65d91e1",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.043",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 43,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1937.4499999999998,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Capture, supported history import and PAIA backup have different scopes. The beta",
        "does not promise complete recovery of an external AI account."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fe483e1c2850",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.044",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 44,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2033.7499999999998,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2033.7499999999998,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.045",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 45,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2060.75,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Does local-first mean no network traffic?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4770789b9c2d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.046",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 46,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2123.75,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. The website is hosted online, the beta application uses a disclosed forwarding",
        "service, and optional external AI has a separate network boundary. Local-first is not an",
        "encryption certification."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9d11af7f9458",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.047",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 47,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2244.7,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2244.7,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.048",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 48,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2271.7,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is a copied passage one of my beliefs?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-92ae6b6a4b7e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.049",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 49,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2334.7,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Not necessarily. It might be a quotation, a job description, a draft, a question or a",
        "role-play. PAIA should preserve that distinction instead of inventing a personal profile."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c97f7ef31fd4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.050",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 50,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2431.0,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2431.0,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.051",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 51,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2458.0,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Can PAIA recall something I sent elsewhere?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d0eb0ef60b44",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.052",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 52,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2521.0,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. PAIA can stop future access that it controls, but cannot recall a copy you have already",
        "sent to another system or exported."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-aaf9ac84cd92",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.053",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 53,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2617.3,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2617.3,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.054",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 54,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2644.3,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is the website example my actual archive?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ebd37bc6c22b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.055",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 55,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2707.3,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. It uses fictional material. It does not connect to your archive or run a live AI model.",
        "Refreshing clears temporary example changes."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-e44b2b70eaf6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-1440.056",
